---
title: "Proposed request and credential selection"
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "16px"
    actorBkg: "#EDF2F7"
    actorBorder: "#879AB0"
    actorTextColor: "#25364A"
    noteBkgColor: "#F7F1E5"
    noteBorderColor: "#B3A078"
    noteTextColor: "#344054"
    signalColor: "#748798"
    signalTextColor: "#25364A"
  sequence:
    useMaxWidth: false
    actorMargin: 16
    width: 110
    height: 42
    diagramMarginX: 12
    diagramMarginY: 12
    messageMargin: 17
    noteMargin: 8
    mirrorActors: true
    wrap: true
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant C as Control plane
  participant S as Secret Driver / Token Service
  participant P as Provider
  A->>G: Operation with identity bearer
  G->>C: Authorize current execution and use
  C-->>G: Allow, deny, or unavailable
  alt Deny or unavailable
    G-->>A: Refuse without forwarding
  else Allow, including cache hits
    alt Static credential
      Note over G,S: Fresh scoped cache hit skips Secret read
      opt Cache miss or refresh
        G->>S: Authenticated Secret read
        S-->>G: Value or typed failure
      end
      Note over G,S: Only eligible temporary errors permit fallback
    else Dynamic credential
      G->>S: Scoped warm token lookup only
      S-->>G: Usable token or failure
    end
    alt Usable scoped material
      G->>P: Strip bearer, inject credential, forward
      P-->>G: Response
      G-->>A: Return response
    else Denied, missing, or unusable material
      G-->>A: Refuse without forwarding
    end
  end
